---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="无忧链接深度测评与使用指南 - 2026 最新评测" 
  description="无忧链接成立于 2024 年底，采用全新 VLESS 协议与 IPLC 专线，运营团队为海外团队，主打稳定、低延迟的线路体验，全天客服轮班响应用户需求。"
>
  <div class="review-page-shell">
    <div class="rp-header">
      <div class="rp-header-left">
        <img src="/images/brands/wuyou.png" alt="无忧链接" class="rp-logo" onerror="this.src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0OCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2U0ZTlmMiIvPjwvc3ZnPg=='" />
        <div class="rp-title-wrap">
        <h1>无忧链接机场深度测评</h1>
        <p class="rp-subtitle">2026年最新测速与解锁报告</p>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rp-header-right">
        <div class="rp-top-promo">
          <span>专属优惠码</span>
          <code>s1kH64A8</code>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wep01.worryfreeaff.com/#/?code=s1kH64A8" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="rp-btn-official-top">
          前往官网注册 <span>↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rp-content">
      <div class="bcp-text-intro">
        <h2>无忧链接简介</h2>
        <p>无忧链接成立于 2024 年底，采用全新 VLESS 协议与 IPLC 专线，运营团队为海外团队，主打稳定、低延迟的线路体验，全天客服轮班响应用户需求。</p>
        
        <h2>节点覆盖</h2>
        <p>无忧链接节点覆盖香港、台湾、新加坡、日本、美国等主流地区，全部套餐不限速、不限制同时在线设备数量。</p>
        
        <h2>流媒体与AI解锁</h2>
        <p>支持解锁 ChatGPT、Gemini 等 AI 工具，以及 Netflix、Disney+、YouTube、TikTok 等国外流媒体与短视频平台。同时官方声明不记录日志、不屏蔽 BT 下载。</p>
        
        <h2>价格套餐</h2>
        <p>轻量级套餐低至 6 元每月，大促期间全新 6.8 折。支持订阅链接无需转换，支持 iOS/安卓/Windows/MAC 等客户端。支持支付宝、微信、USDT 支付，首次订阅享 85 折优惠。</p>
      </div>

                </div>
  </div>

  <style is:inline>

    .rp-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      padding-bottom: 30px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .rp-header-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .rp-header-right {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .rp-top-promo {
      background: #fffbeb;
      border: 1px solid #fde68a;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #b45309;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .rp-top-promo code {
      background: #fef3c7;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #ea580c;
      font-weight: 700;
      user-select: all;
    }
    .rp-btn-official-top {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .rp-btn-official-top:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(59,130,246,0.35);
      color: #fff;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .rp-header {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .rp-header-left {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .rp-header-right {
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }
    }

    .review-page-shell {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 60px 20px 100px;
    }
    
    .rp-logo {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .rp-title-wrap h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .rp-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #64748b;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .bcp-text-intro {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
    }
    .bcp-text-intro h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro h2::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 6px;
      height: 22px;
      background: #3b82f6;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro h2:not(:first-child) {
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    
    .rp-action {
      margin-top: 50px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .rp-btn-back {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #3b82f6;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 2px solid #3b82f6;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .rp-btn-back:hover {
      background: #3b82f6;
      color: #fff;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      
      .bcp-text-intro {
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .bcp-text-intro h2 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }
      .bcp-text-intro p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
    }
      .rp-btn-official:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 25px rgba(59,130,246,0.4) !important;
    }
    .rp-btn-back:hover {
      color: #3b82f6 !important;
      border-color: #3b82f6 !important;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
